Package: knitroff
Type: Package
Title: Dynamic Reports in 'troff' with 'knitr'
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Daniel", "García", email = "pesfan@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Write reports in 'troff' with the 'ms' macros and R code chunks
    between '.SS' and '.SE', the way 'eqn' and 'tbl' blocks sit in a document,
    and turn them into PDF, PostScript or a terminal draft with GNU 'groff'.
    'knitr' runs the code; inline results use `r expr` or '.SR name expr'.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
URL: https://github.com/danielgccr/knitroff
BugReports: https://github.com/danielgccr/knitroff/issues
Encoding: UTF-8
Imports: knitr
Suggests: rstudioapi
SystemRequirements: GNU groff (>= 1.22) for render_roff(); pdfinfo (poppler)
    for figures in PDF output
